), meaning about as expected for these jobs, given method, rain and ward. Of the ₹89,00,000 budget, ₹78,45,240 (88%) is spent across 143 jobs, leaving ₹10,54,760. Repairs held less well than hoped: ₹18,66,600 went on fixes that failed within 30 days, and durability scored 46. Billing scored 44, and ₹20,93,883 is in question. The records show 10 bills above 1.5 times the rate card, 3 duplicate bills, and 29 payments (₹17,14,069) on roads still under the contractor's guarantee period. 25 issues remain open and overdue. Next fixes are three open or broken manholes, a 24-hour safety issue. Juhu Tara Road (₹47,629) is near a flood-prone subway and had an accident. SV Road (₹47,629) had 4 accidents and is near a school. Link Road costs ₹0 if the original contractor is called under the guarantee, and it is also near the school.]]></description><ExtendedData><Data name="ward_code"><value>K/W</value></Data><Data name="ward_name"><value>Andheri West, Juhu, Vile Parle West</value></Data><Data name="zone"><value>Zone 4</value></Data><Data name="grade"><value>C</value></Data><Data name="score"><value>50</value></Data><Data name="budget_inr"><value>8900000</value></Data><Data name="spend_inr"><value>7845240</value></Data><Data name="money_in_question_inr"><value>2093883</value></Data><Data name="open_overdue_issues"><value>25</value></Data></ExtendedData><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>72.80218,19.15778 72.8,19.15 72.80527,19.09727 72.84102,19.09429 72.84149,19.09448 72.85669,19.14006 72.80218,19.15778</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ward P/S · grade C</name><styleUrl>#grade-C</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Grade C</b> (51 of 100; 50 is as expected for these jobs)<br/>Spent ₹43,49,997 of ₹48,00,000 (91%) on 82 jobs<br/>On fixes that failed within 30 days: ₹3,40,751<br/>In question: ₹7,92,887 (5 over-billed, 1 duplicates, 14 paid under DLP)<br/>Open problems past their SLA: 18<br/><br/>P/S (Goregaon) scored 